  "instructions": [
    "Heat the render fat in a large cast-iron skillet over medium-high heat",
    "Add the lamb pieces and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the chopped carrot and potato, and cook for 5 minutes",
    "Add the thyme, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine",
    "Add the plain yogurt and stir to combine",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired"
